{"3609080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "StarSavior", "steam_appid": 3609080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/92f04dfc00d0cbca66ef71ee109c848c.poster.avif?t=1788250675\" width=420 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/92f04dfc00d0cbca66ef71ee109c848c.webm?t=1788250675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/92f04dfc00d0cbca66ef71ee109c848c.mp4?t=1788250675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, the legendary Star Savior defeated the Void Star.<br>Now, the Journey—a trial to inherit the great power he left behind—begins once more.<br>Take on the Journey alongside star-powered girls and inherit the legacy of the Star Savior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/25c5325480f08d5d6a58e749b6e5baf8.poster.avif?t=1788250675\" width=420 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/25c5325480f08d5d6a58e749b6e5baf8.webm?t=1788250675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/25c5325480f08d5d6a58e749b6e5baf8.mp4?t=1788250675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A training RPG to raise a new shining light to illuminate the cosmos in an age where the stars are fading.<br>StarSavior: Guide your Saviors through the star-kissed Journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/25a47cdb0e88c1be676ed0e6d39354fb.poster.avif?t=1788250675\" width=420 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/25a47cdb0e88c1be676ed0e6d39354fb.webm?t=1788250675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/25a47cdb0e88c1be676ed0e6d39354fb.mp4?t=1788250675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ A Journey with girls who wield the power of the stars</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You become the Captain of the Savior Party, tasked with leading the star-powered girls known as Saviors.<br>Forge bonds with star-powered Saviors and lead them through the Journey—to inherit the legacy of the Star Savior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/a61334d8af6b43a45c57766fe45a9ca2.poster.avif?t=1788250675\" width=420 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/a61334d8af6b43a45c57766fe45a9ca2.webm?t=1788250675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/a61334d8af6b43a45c57766fe45a9ca2.mp4?t=1788250675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ Turn-based battles with cinematic skill animations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Savior possesses unique abilities and traits.<br>Combine their distinct skills and attributes with stunning visual effects to build the optimal party,<br>and overcome formidable enemies through turn-based combat guided by your strategy as Captain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph